{
    "Scenarios": [
        {
            "IntroSequence": {
                "SequenceItems": [
                    {
                        "Type": "SlideShow",
                        "Data": {
                            "SlideBackgroundImage": "textures/campaign/fcam1/alaric_background.dds",
                            "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/adrianople/1/intro/1.png",
                            "Sound": "",
                            "Slides": [
                                {
                                    "Duration": 20.0,
                                    "TextFadeDuration": 5.0,
                                    "ImageRect": {
                                        "x": 650,
                                        "y": 600,
                                        "width": 2000,
                                        "height": 1048
                                    },
                                    "String": "The end of the Goths has come. Anyone who has seen our Gothic villages burned and our people slaughtered will know that nothing can stop the Huns wherever they go.",
                                    "TextRect": {
                                        "x": 1850,
                                        "y": 650,
                                        "width": 1000,
                                        "height": 500
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": "SlideShow",
                        "Data": {
                            "SlideBackgroundImage": "textures/campaign/fcam1/alaric_background.dds",
                            "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/adrianople/1/intro/2.png",
                            "Sound": "",
                            "Slides": [
                                {
                                    "Duration": 20.0,
                                    "FadeInTime": 0.0,
                                    "TextFadeDuration": 5.0,
                                    "String": "Wiping away our tears, we abandoned our former homes and fled westward. But fortunately, the road is boundless. The Roman Emperor Valens took a fancy to the bravery of our Gothic warriors. He proposed to give us Goths a foothold in exchange for the loyalty of our warriors. I have to say that this temptation is indeed hard to refuse.",
                                    "TextRect": {
                                        "x": 800,
                                        "y": 600,
                                        "width": 1000,
                                        "height": 300
                                    },
                                    "ImageRect": {
                                        "x": 1000,
                                        "y": 700,
                                        "width": 2000,
                                        "height": 1048
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": "SlideShow",
                        "Data": {
                            "SlideBackgroundImage": "textures/campaign/fcam1/alaric_background.dds",
                            "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/adrianople/1/intro/3.png",
                            "Sound": "",
                            "Slides": [
                                {
                                    "Duration": 20.0,
                                    "FadeOutTime": 0.0,
                                    "TextFadeDuration": 5.0,
                                    "String": "However, we never thought that the cunning of the Romans was more disgusting than the cruelty of the Huns. As soon as we crossed the Danube, we discovered that they would only call us strangers, beggars, and barbarians. The so-called promises of land and food were nothing but empty words, replaced by endless discrimination and exploitation of us Goths.",
                                    "TextRect": {
                                        "x": 1100,
                                        "y": 650,
                                        "width": 780,
                                        "height": 1000
                                    },
                                    "ImageRect": {
                                        "x": 950,
                                        "y": 600,
                                        "width": 2000,
                                        "height": 1048
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": "SlideShow",
                        "Data": {
                            "SlideBackgroundImage": "textures/campaign/fcam1/alaric_background.dds",
                            "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/adrianople/1/intro/4.png",
                            "Sound": "",
                            "Slides": [
                                {
                                    "Duration": 20.0,
                                    "TextFadeDuration": 5.0,
                                    "String": "If we had swallowed our anger, we would have been squeezed dry like slaves rather than warriors and died in disgrace on Roman soil. Therefore I, Aravius, chief of the Goths, will join with my people in tearing up the letters of supplication and drawing the sword of the warrior. We will burn the proud Romans under the wrath of the Goths!",
                                    "TextRect": {
                                        "x": 1000,
                                        "y": 500,
                                        "width": 1000,
                                        "height": 300
                                    },
                                    "ImageRect": {
                                        "x": 1500,
                                        "y": 800,
                                        "width": 2000,
                                        "height": 1048
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                ]
            },
            "OutroSequence": {
                "SequenceItems": [
                    {
                        "Type": "SlideShow",
                        "Data": {
                            "SlideBackgroundImage": "textures/campaign/fcam1/alaric_background.dds",
                            "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/adrianople/1/outro/1.png",
                            "Sound": "",
                            "Slides": [
                                {
                                    "Duration": 25.0,
                                    "TextFadeDuration": 5.0,
                                    "ImageRect": {
                                        "x": 850,
                                        "y": 950,
                                        "width": 2500,
                                        "height": 1048
                                    },
                                    "String": "The reckless Roman emperor first gave up the reinforcements from his nephew Gratian, and then asked his men to march to the battlefield in a hurry. Hum, how could these exhausted Romans who violated the tactics of war be the opponents of our well-prepared Gothic warriors who were waiting for work. The cavalry on both sides of them were vulnerable to the impact of our cavalry and fled in all directions, leaving their friendly infantry to be ruthlessly surrounded and slaughtered by us. Even the emperor himself was found and burned to death in a hut after being seriously injured.",
                                    "TextRect": {
                                        "x": 1050,
                                        "y": 600,
                                        "width": 1800,
                                        "height": 1100
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": "SlideShow",
                        "Data": {
                            "SlideBackgroundImage": "textures/campaign/fcam1/alaric_background.dds",
                            "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/adrianople/1/outro/2.png",
                            "Sound": "",
                            "Slides": [
                                {
                                    "Duration": 25.0,
                                    "TextFadeDuration": 5.0,
                                    "ImageRect": {
                                        "x": 1050,
                                        "y": 950,
                                        "width": 2000,
                                        "height": 900
                                    },
                                    "String": "Now, there is no decent army in the east of Rome that can stop us. Where to go next, Mercia, Thrace, or Macedonia? No, our appetite is much more than that.",
                                    "TextRect": {
                                        "x": 1050,
                                        "y": 600,
                                        "width": 1800,
                                        "height": 1100
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": "SlideShow",
                        "Data": {
                            "SlideBackgroundImage": "textures/campaign/fcam1/alaric_background.dds",
                            "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/adrianople/1/outro/3.png",
                            "Sound": "",
                            "Slides": [
                                {
                                    "Duration": 25.0,
                                    "TextFadeDuration": 5.0,
                                    "ImageRect": {
                                        "x": 850,
                                        "y": 950,
                                        "width": 2500,
                                        "height": 1048
                                    },
                                    "String": "Since the founding of Constantinople, the eastern capital of Rome, no enemy has been able to reach its gates. And soon, we Goths will be its first challengers.",
                                    "TextRect": {
                                        "x": 1050,
                                        "y": 600,
                                        "width": 1800,
                                        "height": 1100
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Type": "SlideShow",
                        "Data": {
                            "SlideBackgroundImage": "textures/campaign/fcam1/alaric_background.dds",
                            "SlideImageSequence": "textures/campaign/adrianople/1/outro/4.png",
                            "Sound": "",
                            "Slides": [
                                {
                                    "Duration": 25.0,
                                    "TextFadeDuration": 5.0,
                                    "ImageRect": {
                                        "x": 850,
                                        "y": 950,
                                        "width": 2500,
                                        "height": 1048
                                    },
                                    "String": "Our war with Rome may have just begun, but I believe that with the heroic fighting of the Gothic warriors, one day we will establish our own kingdom on the old soil of Rome!",
                                    "TextRect": {
                                        "x": 1050,
                                        "y": 600,
                                        "width": 1800,
                                        "height": 1100
                                    }
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
}